================================================================================
ENGINEERING DISCLAIMER - READ THIS PART
================================================================================

This software performs engineering calculations. It is NOT a substitute for a
qualified engineer, and nothing it produces is a certified design.

  - Every output is UNCERTIFIED. The software will not stamp, certify or
    approve any design, and refuses requests to do so.
  - Results must be independently checked by a competent person before being
    used for anything that can hurt someone or cost money.
  - The authors accept no liability for decisions made using this software.
    See the warranty disclaimer above; it applies in full to engineering
    output, not only to the code.

