  CalculiX (GPL-2.0), OpenFOAM (GPL-3.0), Elmer FEM (LGPL-2.1 / GPL-2.0),
  ngspice (BSD-3-Clause / GPL), gmsh (GPL-2.0), FreeCAD (LGPL-2.1),
  PyChrono (BSD-3-Clause), pycalphad (MIT).
Invoking a GPL program as a separate process does not make this software GPL,
but redistributing those binaries does carry their terms. They are NOT
redistributed here; they are expected to be installed by the user.

STANDARDS. Eurocodes, ISO, ASME, ASTM, API, IEC and DIN documents are
copyrighted by their publishers and are NOT included. Where this software
implements a calculation defined by a standard, it implements the FORMULA the
standard specifies and uses published tables only as test oracles. Clause text
is not reproduced. Users needing the standard must license it themselves.

REFERENCE DATA. CODATA constants, NIST thermochemical data, IAPWS-IF97 and the
ISA atmosphere are used under their own public terms and are cited in
refdata.py.

RESEARCH DATASETS fetched by data_fetch.py or research_corpus/scripts remain
under the licences of their depositors. They are NOT redistributed with this
repository - research_corpus/.gitignore excludes them deliberately. Files whose
licence cannot be determined are placed in a quarantine directory and marked
local-use-only; do not publish or redistribute those.

LANGUAGE MODELS. Any model served through Ollama or a cloud API carries its own
licence and terms of use. Check them before commercial deployment.
